WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:35.541 --> 00:00:36.583
Welcome.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.250
Thanks for having me.

00:00:39.166 --> 00:00:40.291
I bought the ingredients.

00:00:44.125 --> 00:00:45.666
I'm borrowing some fridge space.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.000
Okay.

00:00:47.125 --> 00:00:50.125
I bought some pudding too,
so let's have that for dessert.

00:00:50.541 --> 00:00:51.458
Thank you.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.750
What's wrong?

00:01:03.916 --> 00:01:06.291
I was just thinking your place
is cleaner than I expected.

00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:08.416
I'll prepare the food now.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.125
Um, okay.

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.333
You're amazing.

00:01:29.916 --> 00:01:30.916
What's wrong?

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.833
Nothing, there's just
not enough air in here.

00:01:33.333 --> 00:01:34.583
I'm sorry, though.

00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:37.583
Bass isn't very interesting
on its own, is it?

00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:39.041
Really?

00:01:39.125 --> 00:01:40.125
But I like it.

00:01:47.666 --> 00:01:48.583
Huh? What is it?

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:52.250
Something smells real good.
Oh yeah, we have curry, don't we?

00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:54.958
Wow, I'm super hungry now, Inui.

00:01:55.041 --> 00:01:57.041
Wanna go ahead and eat?

00:02:00.041 --> 00:02:02.041
You're right. Let's eat.

00:02:04.166 --> 00:02:07.791
I'm Team Curry on Rice. What about you?

00:02:07.875 --> 00:02:10.000
Hm... Team Curry and Rice.

00:02:10.083 --> 00:02:12.375
You don't say? Roger that.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.166
Can I use your bathroom?

00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:17.541
Of course.

00:02:17.625 --> 00:02:18.833
Thank you.

00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:46.625
Inui, I'm sorry.

00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:49.708
I accidentally poured the curry
on top of both.

00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:51.500
Hm?

00:02:52.583 --> 00:02:54.125
Inui?

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.625
-I'm going home.
-What?

00:03:04.333 --> 00:03:05.583
What about the curry?

00:03:05.666 --> 00:03:07.458
You can have it, Haida.

00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:11.000
Once it's cold, you can put it
in the fridge and have it tomorrow.

00:03:11.375 --> 00:03:14.041
Wait, Inui.

00:03:17.791 --> 00:03:18.750
I'm sorry.

00:03:21.416 --> 00:03:23.791
You haven't done anything
to warrant an apology.

00:03:24.125 --> 00:03:26.250
It's fine for now.

00:03:31.041 --> 00:03:33.458
Please just tell me one thing.

00:03:36.958 --> 00:03:39.916
Do you like me?

